[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8220.669, "timestamp": "02:17:00", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8224.309, "timestamp": "02:17:04", "text": "我很喜欢，我正在看画框师……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8228.629, "timestamp": "02:17:08", "text": "这个框架挺酷的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8231.19, "timestamp": "02:17:11", "text": "真不错。是的，就像你可以制作的那种。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8233.429, "timestamp": "02:17:13", "text": "你自己的东西，然后更换电池"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8234.869, "timestamp": "02:17:14", "text": "一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8240.669, "timestamp": "02:17:20", "text": "这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8243.75, "timestamp": "02:17:23", "text": "好的。看起来不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8247.429, "timestamp": "02:17:27", "text": "我对移动处理器不太了解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8251.709, "timestamp": "02:17:31", "text": "还有其他一些东西。或许你可以调查一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8255.95, "timestamp": "02:17:35", "text": "好的。还有，你……你还有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8259.27, "timestamp": "02:17:39", "text": "你的3D模型都设置好了吗？难道不是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8262.389, "timestamp": "02:17:42", "text": "用那个吗？嗯，我的3D设备其实丢了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8265.509, "timestamp": "02:17:45", "text": "东西。新模型被翻转了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8267.429, "timestamp": "02:17:47", "text": "文件什么的都弄丢了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8271.03, "timestamp": "02:17:51", "text": "哦，不。嗯，我不得不重置我的电脑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8273.75, "timestamp": "02:17:53", "text": "所以我忘记备份那些文件了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8275.669, "timestamp": "02:17:55", "text": "所以当我重装Windows系统后，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8277.99, "timestamp": "02:17:57", "text": "完全跟他们走散了。所以现在我确实有了一个"}]